= Second Zhili-Fengtian War

War has erupted between the Zhili and Fengtian cliques after the Zhili attacked Anhui-ruled Zhejiang. In response, Zhang Zuolin's Fengtian Clique have marched against the Zhili in *Shanhaiguan*.
Zhang Zuolin has invited us into a three-pronged alliance against Cao Kun and Wu Peifu along with Lu Yongxiang, governor of Zhejiang.

- @next: We march to defeat Zhili and liberate Zhejiang!

@next
on-arrival: bei_strength -= 10; feng_strength -= 10;

Unfortunately, the Cantonese Merchant Corps Uprising have tied our hands, and we are unable to fight. Chen Jiongming's influence in the east also halts our advance.

However, the fight between Wu Peifu and Zhang Zuolin intensifies in Shanhaiguan. It is not obvious who will win this one.
